title: Packed projection package installation exceeds its deadline on the shared development host
description: "During #202 verification at main 03c3059, the unchanged packed projection test timed out in package install before its import assertions. Two repaired-fixture attempts, including one using the existing public npm cache, hit the same unchanged 45-second child deadline. This is a local validation limitation, not evidence of import corruption or a cleanup regression. Investigate installation cost and shared-host contention without raising command/test deadlines, weakening coverage, or using live provider data. Final-head hosted npm/Bun Node22/26 evidence is tracked separately by pm-github-mes8."
